OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of shooting girlfriend
OL,4,Ain the face
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of shooting his
OL,7,F19-year-old girlfriend in the face has
OL,8,Fappeared at the Old Bailey.
OL,10,FJamie Duncan, 21, allegedly killed
OL,11,FIsraa Djeddou in the bedroom of her
OL,12,Ffamily home in Barnet, north London, in
OL,13,Fthe early hours of 8 June.
OL,15,FOn Tuesday, he appeared in court by
OL,16,Fvideo-link from Wormwood Scrubs prison
OL,17,Fcharged with murder and three firearms
OL,18,Foffences. He was not asked to enter a
OL,19,Fplea.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
